    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the labor law, in relation to granting collective bargaining\nrights to farm laborers and allowing farm laborers one day of rest each week\nand including farm laborers within the provisions pertaining to overtime\ncompensation and unemployment insurance; to amend the public health law, in\nrelation to the application of the sanitary code to all farm and food\nprocessing labor camps for migrant workers; to amend the workers' compensation\nlaw, in relation to the eligibility of farm laborers for workers' compensation\nbenefits and the provision of claim forms to farm laborers injured in the\ncourse of employment and in relation to service as farm laborers; to amend the\nlabor law, in relation to labor on a farm and regulating the employment of\ncertain employees whose earning capacity is affected or impaired by youth or\nage; and to amend the labor law, in relation to unfair labor practices,\nimpasse resolution procedures and the convening of a farm laborers wage board",
